    // the "any target" (player or creature) form, and ember-reckoning a modal "Choose one"
    // spell -- the mode names the branch frResolveSpellEffect takes, each with its own
    // targeting. All three declare their target requirements on the record (targeting/modes),
    // the way every effect-consuming card must from here on.
    "twin-dart": {
